      "category": "PRIORITY",
      "priority": 3,
      "summary": "This email thread discusses a productivity report sent from Sachin M, a Medical Records Reviewer, to Donna Shaughnessy, the Senior and VP Practice Administrator at Horizon Family Medical Group. The report details specific work metrics: 100 tasks in Quest, 1 in Labcorp, 11 in Failed RX, and 40 in Stellar, all reported on September 2, 2026. Donna acknowledges receipt of the report with a simple thank you.",
